        rdfs:label "Drosophila affinis Turing wavenumber at 2.4 µm (Holocene, detail tier) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 82/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Side-by-side, the female habitus (red eye, banded abdomen, 250 µm scale bar, age 0 Ma) sits next to a spot field whose FFT wavelength is 2.432 µm. The GIF interior is that habitus, so computer-vision similarity is high by construction of the adult frame. The spots are a generated pigment field, not a copy of the tergite bands, and the photograph does not resolve 2.444 µm." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
